## 7.3 Descriptive Statistics (Table 1)
Requirements:
- Explain the overall purpose of Table 1: Describe basic characteristics of the study population (demographics, lifestyle, clinical metrics, etc.);
- Outline presentation methods for variables in Table 1 (e.g., Mean ± SD or Median [IQR] for continuous variables, Frequency and Percentage for categorical variables);
- If descriptive_statistics.table1_narrative_for_protocol has a complete paragraph, use it after integrating language;
- If complex sampling design exists, need to explain descriptive statistics will use weighted estimates, stratification and clustering corrections, etc.

Then write:
## 7.4 Bivariate Exploratory Analysis
