  - Whether to adopt Rao-Scott correction etc. under complex sampling design;
  - Whether to control for multiple comparisons (e.g., only report p-value, no strict multiple correction, but emphasize bivariate results are for exploration only).
Do not list every exposure-outcome pair in the main text, these will go into the appendix.

【content_md_appendix】
Please return an empty string "" for content_md_appendix in this node.

【needs】
List missing info related to 7.3, 7.4 in needs, e.g.:
- Grouping cutoffs for certain key variables not yet determined;
- Whether bivariate analysis needs formal inference by complex sampling weights needs confirmation.
If none return [].

【Output Format】
Please strictly output the following JSON object:
{
  "chapter": 7,
  "title": "7. Statistical Methods",
  "content_md_main": "Write Markdown body containing ## 7.3 and ## 7.4 here.",
